  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Disable Device 5 ranks, Infiltration sphere (Ranged Disable).</p>\n<p>You can apply a (sabotage) talent or perform other complex forms of sabotage at range as long as you can perform the check as a full-round action or faster. Concealment does not prevent your attempt, but merely adds a miss chance. Cover less than total increases the Disable Device DC by the AC bonus it grants instead of preventing the attempt. You do not increase the DC for inappropriate tools if the check is simple sabotage, opening a lock, or rendering a device inoperative without hiding your tampering.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/infiltration#toc45\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
